--------------------------------------
- How Can We Read Input From a File? -
---------------------------------------

You have already used a Scanner object to read input from the user through the keyboard. We can also use a Scanner 
to read data from files. Instead of creating a Scanner attached to System.in (the keyboard by default), we open a 
file (using a FileInputStream object), and instantiate a Scanner attached to the FileInputStream. Here's an example.

